        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Oneworld, Finnair\n- Topics: airline alliances, flag carriers, airline hubs\n- Places: Finland, Vantaa, Helsinki Airport\n\nFacts:\n- Oneworld is an airline alliance that was founded on 1 February 1999.\n- Oneworld is marketed as oneworld and has the CRS code *O.\n- Finnair is the flag carrier and largest airline of Finland.\n- Finnair has its headquarters in Vantaa on the grounds of Helsinki Airport, which is its main hub.\n- Finnair is named Finnair Oyj in Finnish and Finnair Abp in Swedish.",
